Package: betwixt
Title: Scoped Semantic Claims and Human Review Workflows
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person(
      given = "Daniel",
      family = "Antal",
      email = "daniel.antal@dataobservatory.eu",
      role = c("aut", "cre"),
      comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-7513-6760")
    )
Description: Creates, manages and reviews scoped semantic claims.
    Betwixt provides a lightweight semantic layer between observations,
    human review workflows and graph-based representations. Claims are
    represented as scoped assertions and can be rendered for review,
    exported to graph formats, or integrated into dataset-oriented
    workflows.
